---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import JobJourney from '../components/JobJourney.astro'
import RoleExplorer from '../components/RoleExplorer'
import FieldTerrain from '../components/FieldTerrain'

const appUrl = (import.meta.env.PUBLIC_APP_URL || 'https://dothecoolwip1.github.io/NorthBorn/').replace(/\/?$/, '/')
const clientUrl = new URL('client-join', appUrl).toString()

const systems = [
  ['01', 'Dispatch', 'Build the day around the people and equipment that can actually do the work.'],
  ['02', 'Jobs', 'Keep customer, site, scope, schedule, crew, unit and status on one operating record.'],
  ['03', 'Field', 'Put safety, tickets, time and job details in the operator’s hand without office clutter.'],
  ['04', 'Fleet', 'Tie availability, defects, inspections, maintenance and downtime back to operations.'],
  ['05', 'Billing', 'Move approved work toward pricing, invoicing, delivery and payment without re-entry.'],
  ['06', 'Clients', 'Give customers a clean portal for their jobs, signed tickets and account activity.'],
]

const realities = [
  ['Weak service', 'Field work does not stop because the signal bar disappeared.'],
  ['Dirty hands', 'Important actions need to be obvious, large and fast to hit.'],
  ['Last-minute changes', 'Dispatch needs to change without breaking the rest of the record.'],
  ['Different jobs', 'A hydrovac day does not run exactly like water hauling, steaming or environmental work.'],
]
---

<BaseLayout>
  <div class="site-shell">
    <header class="site-nav">
      <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="Northborn home">
        <b>N</b>
        <span><strong>NORTHBORN</strong><small>FIELD OPERATIONS</small></span>
      </a>
      <nav aria-label="Public navigation">
        <a href="#journey">Workflow</a>
        <a href="#roles">Product</a>
        <a href="#system">Platform</a>
        <a href="#field">Built for the field</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="nav-actions">
        <a class="nav-client" href={clientUrl}>Client portal</a>
        <a class="button small" href={appUrl}>Open Northborn <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero" id="top">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <div class="eyebrow"><span>01</span> BUILT FOR FIELD OPERATIONS</div>
          <h1>THE FIELD<br/>DOESN’T RUN<br/><em>FROM A DESK.</em></h1>
          <div class="hero-bottom">
            <p>Neither should your software. Northborn connects dispatch, crews, trucks, field paperwork, clients and billing around the work that is actually happening.</p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a class="button" href={appUrl}>Open Northborn <span>↗</span></a>
              <a class="text-link" href="#journey">Watch a job move <span>↓</span></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Northborn live operations visual">
          <div class="hero-mobile-photo" aria-hidden="true">
            <img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/37793901/pexels-photo-37793901.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200" alt="" />
            <span></span>
          </div>
          <FieldTerrain client:visible />
          <div class="hero-coordinate top">52.2681° N · 113.8112° W</div>
          <div class="hero-coordinate bottom">CENTRAL ALBERTA · FIELD OPS</div>
          <div class="hero-crosshair" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div>

          <div class="hero-operation">
            <div class="operation-top">
              <span>LIVE OPERATION</span>
              <i></i>
              <strong>NB-1048</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="operation-status">
              <small>07:03</small>
              <strong>Hydrovac daylighting</strong>
              <span>RED DEER COUNTY · UNIT 214</span>
            </div>
            <div class="operation-crew">
              <div><small>CREW</small><strong>Cody · Mark</strong></div>
              <div><small>STATUS</small><strong class="live">ON SITE</strong></div>
            </div>
            <div class="operation-track">
              <span class="done">REQUEST</span><i></i>
              <span class="done">DISPATCH</span><i></i>
              <span class="active">FIELD</span><i></i>
              <span>SIGNED</span><i></i>
              <span>BILLING</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-stamp">
            <span>FIELD-BUILT</span>
            <strong>NORTHBORN</strong>
            <small>OPS SYSTEM · 2026</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="manifesto">
        <p>Most field companies do not have an information problem.</p>
        <h2>They have a <em>handoff</em> problem.</h2>
        <div class="manifesto-line">
          <span>CALL</span><i></i><span>DISPATCH</span><i></i><span>FIELD</span><i></i><span>PAPERWORK</span><i></i><span>BILLING</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <JobJourney />

      <section class="roles-section" id="roles">
        <div class="section-index"><span>02</span><b>PRODUCT VIEWS</b></div>
        <div class="section-heading split">
          <h2>One operation.<br/><em>Different jobs to do.</em></h2>
          <p>A manager, an operator and a client should not be forced through the same dashboard. Northborn changes the interface around the person using it.</p>
        </div>
        <RoleExplorer client:idle />
      </section>

      <section class="system-section" id="system">
        <div class="system-intro">
          <div class="section-index"><span>03</span><b>THE SYSTEM</b></div>
          <h2>NOT SIX APPS.<br/><em>ONE OPERATING RECORD.</em></h2>
          <p>The point is not to give the company more software. The point is to stop the same job from being recreated every time it changes hands.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="system-map">
          <div class="system-spine" aria-hidden="true"><span>N</span></div>
          <div class="system-list">
            {systems.map(([number, title, body]) => (
              <article>
                <span>{number}</span>
                <h3>{title}</h3>
                <p>{body}</p>
                <b>CONNECTED</b>
              </article>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="field-section" id="field">
        <div class="field-title">
          <div class="section-index light"><span>04</span><b>BUILT FOR THE REAL CONDITIONS</b></div>
          <h2>SHOP.<br/>TRUCK.<br/>FIELD.<br/><em>OFFICE.</em></h2>
        </div>

        <div class="field-reality">
          <p class="field-lead">Northborn is being built around industrial service work, where software has to survive the operation instead of asking the operation to become cleaner.</p>
          <div class="reality-list">
            {realities.map(([title, body], index) => (
              <article>
                <span>{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
                <div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{body}</p></div>
              </article>
            ))}
          </div>
          <div class="industry-run">
            <span>HYDROVAC</span><span>VACUUM</span><span>STEAMING</span><span>WATER</span><span>TRUCKING</span><span>ENVIRONMENTAL</span><span>CONSTRUCTION</span><span>OILFIELD</span><span>INDUSTRIAL</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="closing">
        <div class="closing-copy">
          <span>FIELD OPERATIONS · ONE PLACE</span>
          <h2>RUN THE WORK.<br/><em>NOT THE PAPER CHASE.</em></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="closing-actions">
          <p>Open Northborn, create your workspace, or enter through the customer portal.</p>
          <a class="button inverse" href={appUrl}>Open Northborn <span>↗</span></a>
          <a class="closing-client" href={clientUrl}>Client portal <span>→</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <a class="brand" href="#top">
        <b>N</b>
        <span><strong>NORTHBORN</strong><small>FIELD OPERATIONS</small></span>
      </a>
      <p>Field operations, built from the field.</p>
      <div><a href="#journey">Workflow</a><a href="#roles">Product</a><a href="#system">Platform</a><a href={appUrl}>Sign in</a></div>
    </footer>

    <div class="mobile-dock">
      <div><strong>NORTHBORN</strong><span>FIELD OPERATIONS</span></div>
      <a href={appUrl}>OPEN <span>↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
